# hermes — workspace-local ignores (workspace deps are hoisted to root node_modules)

# Environment — contains WORK_DIR and optional API_KEY
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Runtime database (per-install, never committed)
hermes.db
hermes.db-journal
hermes.db-wal
hermes.db-shm

# Runtime artifacts emitted by the agents — these belong to each user's runs,
# not to the repo. They regenerate on every task. Build-History/ holds past tasks.
*-Plan.md
*-Build-Log.md
*-Build-Feedback.md
*-WarZone.md
Build-History/
WarZone-History/


# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
